  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "They should add an option in game where you can view a log to see what's recently been updated in a world. I often look at my recently updated favorites and I don't know what has been updated. Some maps have a log in game that the developers add but it's not a requirement and it's annoying having to join the world just to see what's new or just to figure out that it was minor bug fixes or something. They should add another top tab where the details and author tabs are that world creators can put a log of updates to the world in. They could also add it in the action menu or even make it so it's only viewable on the website if it's too difficult to add in game. I think that this would help with quality of life and would be a simple addition although I have no idea how difficult it would be to add something like this.",
